                <pb facs="0321" n="211" xml:id="pg211"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/2172: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-16T18:00:00+01:00">October 16, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 16—1:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>209. Consulate’s 208, October 16, 6 [<hi rendition="#italic">5</hi>] p.m. Council
                    met at 6 p.m. and I delivered statement. I understand that you are releasing in
                    Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
